    "b44ee0a4-5685-4b3c-9b6e-a37eb61b115d": {
      "type": "abz-testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "ad218cc8-9c05-40e7-885d-1de499a793d7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "abz_testi_desc": "I don't usually leave reviews, but I must say that I am so thankful to have found this site. I live in Hawai'i and it is so difficult to get large/ heavy things shipped here without spending over +$100, but Sheffield has free shipping here for a lot of things on their site, even 50lb Clay. Because of this I am able to practice my hobby and not spend a fortune.",
            "abz_testi_author": "- Ariana Babineaux"
          }
        },
        "0ce22f9d-5157-4bfd-bd69-87622871914c": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "abz_testi_desc": "I love Sheffield Pottery and the people who work there. The other day I received notice that my glazes were shipped. The problem is I realized the place I asked to have it shipped  was not my home, but to a friend clear across the country! Obviously, a careless error on my part!<br><br>\n\nI emailed Sheffield even though it was still only 6 AM and their store did not open until 8:30 AM. I was totally freaked out knowing that once some thing is shipped, it would be pretty difficult if not impossible to get it rerouted.<br>\n\nAt 8:30 I called their store and while I was being helped, I realized I had already received a return email from my 6 o’clock request for help.<br>\n\nThe problem was already taken care of by an employee, Jen R., who obviously is the kind of employee every company would love to have.<br>\n\nJen  must have been to work either early or right on time to catch my cry for help, call the warehouse, find out that it had not yet shipped, and had the delivery address corrected! What a go-getter!  She made my day!<br>\n\nI love Sheffield Pottery and their free shipping on so many items, but knowing the kind of work ethic and their concern for a customer care will make me think of them first, before I check any other Pottery store!<br>\n\nKudos to Sheffield and special shout out to Jen R.!",
            "abz_testi_author": "- Ellen Bettencourt"
          }
        },
        "7ccc3b64-365c-4915-8cdd-2d5e4c73ed1e": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "abz_testi_desc": "Dealing with these people was extremely delightful… They took the time to help me order a wheel, (had some trouble with my card being denied) Sheffield Team was able to fix the problem and the wheel delivered so quick… Couldn’t be happier with the service and care. Thank you guys so much. Can’t wait for the wife to open!!",
            "abz_testi_author": "-  \"Gotta Watch It\""
          }
        },
        "6ee4c5b5-08b6-4c6f-b577-4f6ac646324d": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "abz_testi_desc": "Amazing service\nIt is not easy to ship a follow of glaze and have it arrive not leaking. Not only did it arrive in pristine condition, it got to me very quickly. I will shop here again!",
            "abz_testi_author": "- NANETTE R."
          }
        },
        "8666d1e4-3f30-4148-932f-935664266c0b": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "abz_testi_desc": "Great Source for Quality Glaze\nThey had everything I was looking for at a fair price.",
            "abz_testi_author": "- TODD L."
          }
        },
        "98febb0d-1558-45bb-b6bb-dd89b75a71fe": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "abz_testi_desc": "Satin... nice yellow!\nI find that this glaze when applied either by dipping or brush is a consistent winner. There is just enough sheen to the satin texture to make the color pop! Even flow without runs makes for predictable results.",
            "abz_testi_author": "- THOMAS L."
          }
        },
        "74548b73-43fd-4cd8-b14c-2a173e53554e": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "abz_testi_desc": "We've done business with Sheffield for over a decade, and our experience has been consistently positive.  I've run into a few snafu's with a recent order, and I hope that isn't indicative of a trend.  (Being ghosted on an email thread, the wrong product getting delivered, and unenthusiastic costumer service over the phone.)  I still recommend Sheffield, based on their former performance.  If the next few orders go well, I'll amend this review accordingly.  Everyone's entitled to a bad day and their good days vastly outweigh my recent experience.",
            "abz_testi_author": "- Wheel House Studio"
          }
        }
      },
